Walmart's consolidated operating income for the fiscal year ended January 31, 2025 (fiscal 2025) was $29,348 million [1], which is about $29.3 billion. That compares with $27,012 million in fiscal 2024 and $20,428 million in fiscal 2023 [1]. As a share of net sales, operating income was 4.4% in fiscal 2025 [1].

By segment, Sam's Club U.S. reported operating income of $2,404 million [2] and Walmart International reported $5,501 million [3]. The filing says Walmart U.S. segment operating income rose $1.7 billion [4] versus the prior year.